) VALUES (
    'cornelia-huetter-profile',
    '{"en": "Cornelia Hütter: Austria''s Speed Queen Returns", "de": "Cornelia Hütter: Österreichs Speed-Queen kehrt zurück", "fr": "Cornelia Hütter : Le retour de la reine de vitesse autrichienne", "it": "Cornelia Hütter: Il ritorno della regina della velocità austriaca", "es": "Cornelia Hütter: El regreso de la reina de la velocidad austriaca", "pt": "Cornelia Hütter: O retorno da rainha da velocidade austríaca", "nl": "Cornelia Hütter: Oostenrijks snelheidskoningin keert terug", "ar": "كورنيليا هوتر: عودة ملكة السرعة النمساوية", "ja": "コルネリア・ヒュッター：オーストリアのスピードクイーンの復活", "zh": "Cornelia Huetter: Aodili Sudu Nvwang Guilai", "ko": "코르넬리아 휘터: 오스트리아 스피드 퀸의 귀환"}'::jsonb,
    '{"en": "After overcoming serious injuries, Hütter has returned stronger than ever. The Austrian speed specialist is now among the world''s best in downhill and super-G.", "de": "Nach der Überwindung schwerer Verletzungen ist Hütter stärker denn je zurückgekehrt.", "fr": "Après avoir surmonté de graves blessures, Hütter est revenue plus forte que jamais.", "it": "Dopo aver superato gravi infortuni, Hütter è tornata più forte che mai.", "es": "Después de superar graves lesiones, Hütter ha vuelto más fuerte que nunca.", "pt": "Depois de superar lesões graves, Hütter voltou mais forte do que nunca.", "nl": "Na het overwinnen van ernstige blessures is Hütter sterker dan ooit teruggekeerd.", "ar": "بعد التغلب على إصابات خطيرة، عادت هوتر أقوى من أي وقت مضى", "ja": "深刻な怪我を乗り越えた後、ヒュッターはかつてないほど強く復帰しました。", "zh": "Zai kefu yanzhong shangbing hou, Huetter bi yiqian geng qiangda de guilai le.", "ko": "심각한 부상을 극복한 후 휘터는 어느 때보다 강하게 돌아왔습니다."}'::jsonb,
    '{"en": "<p>Cornelia Hütter''s story is one of determination and comeback. The Austrian <a href=\"/alpine-skiing-guide/\">alpine skier</a> has overcome multiple serious injuries to establish herself as one of the world''s premier speed specialists.</p><h2>The Comeback Story</h2><p>Hütter''s career has been marked by both brilliance and adversity. Serious knee injuries threatened to end her career, but she refused to give up. Her patience and dedication during rehabilitation have been rewarded with performances that rank among the best of her career.</p><p>Now fully healthy, Hütter has shown she can compete with anyone in the world on the fastest courses.</p><h2>Speed Events</h2><p>In downhill and super-G, Hütter combines technical precision with fearless speed. Her ability to maintain composure on challenging terrain makes her dangerous on any course.</p><p>She races against the world''s best including <a href=\"/sofia-goggia-profile/\">Sofia Goggia</a>, <a href=\"/lara-gut-behrami-profile/\">Lara Gut-Behrami</a>, and <a href=\"/mikaela-shiffrin-profile/\">Mikaela Shiffrin</a>.</p><h2>Austrian Speed Tradition</h2><p>Hütter carries on Austria''s proud tradition in speed events. Racing alongside teammates like <a href=\"/vincent-kriechmayr-profile/\">Vincent Kriechmayr</a>, she represents the next generation of Austrian speed skiing excellence.</p><h2>Racing Ahead</h2><p>With her injuries behind her, Hütter is focused on winning major titles. Her combination of experience, technique, and newfound confidence makes her a genuine threat for victory every time she starts.</p>", "de": "<p>Cornelia Hütters Geschichte ist eine von Entschlossenheit und Comeback. Die österreichische <a href=\"/alpine-skiing-guide/\">Skirennläuferin</a> hat mehrere schwere Verletzungen überwunden.</p><h2>Die Comeback-Geschichte</h2><p>Hütters Karriere war von Brillanz und Widrigkeiten geprägt. Schwere Knieverletzungen drohten ihre Karriere zu beenden, aber sie gab nicht auf.</p><h2>Speed-Disziplinen</h2><p>In Abfahrt und Super-G kombiniert Hütter technische Präzision mit furchtloser Geschwindigkeit.</p><p>Sie fährt gegen die Weltbesten wie <a href=\"/sofia-goggia-profile/\">Sofia Goggia</a> und <a href=\"/lara-gut-behrami-profile/\">Lara Gut-Behrami</a>.</p><h2>Österreichische Speed-Tradition</h2><p>Hütter führt Österreichs stolze Tradition in Speed-Disziplinen fort.</p>", "fr": "<p>L''histoire de Cornelia Hütter est celle de la détermination et du retour. La skieuse alpine autrichienne a surmonté plusieurs blessures graves pour s''imposer parmi les meilleures spécialistes de vitesse.</p><h2>L''histoire du retour</h2><p>La carrière de Hütter a été marquée par le talent et l''adversité. De graves blessures au genou menaçaient de mettre fin à sa carrière.</p><h2>Épreuves de vitesse</h2><p>En descente et super-G, Hütter combine précision technique et vitesse intrépide.</p><p>Elle affronte <a href=\"/sofia-goggia-profile/\">Sofia Goggia</a> et <a href=\"/lara-gut-behrami-profile/\">Lara Gut-Behrami</a>.</p>", "it": "<p>La storia di Cornelia Hütter è una di determinazione e ritorno. La sciatrice alpina austriaca ha superato diversi gravi infortuni per affermarsi tra le migliori specialiste della velocità.</p><h2>La storia del ritorno</h2><p>La carriera di Hütter è stata segnata da brillantezza e avversità.</p><h2>Gare di velocità</h2><p>In discesa e super-G, Hütter combina precisione tecnica con velocità impavida.</p><p>Gareggia contro <a href=\"/sofia-goggia-profile/\">Sofia Goggia</a> e <a href=\"/lara-gut-behrami-profile/\">Lara Gut-Behrami</a>.</p>", "es": "<p>La historia de Cornelia Hütter es una de determinación y regreso. La esquiadora alpina austriaca ha superado múltiples lesiones graves.</p><h2>Historia de regreso</h2><p>La carrera de Hütter ha estado marcada por la brillantez y la adversidad.</p><h2>Pruebas de velocidad</h2><p>En descenso y super-G, Hütter combina precisión técnica con velocidad intrépida.</p>", "pt": "<p>A história de Cornelia Hütter é uma de determinação e retorno. A esquiadora alpina austríaca superou múltiplas lesões graves.</p><h2>História de retorno</h2><p>A carreira de Hütter foi marcada por brilhantismo e adversidade.</p><h2>Provas de velocidade</h2><p>No downhill e super-G, Hütter combina precisão técnica com velocidade destemida.</p>", "nl": "<p>Het verhaal van Cornelia Hütter is er een van vastberadenheid en comeback. De Oostenrijkse alpine skiër heeft meerdere ernstige blessures overwonnen.</p><h2>Comeback verhaal</h2><p>Hütters carrière is gekenmerkt door briljantie en tegenspoed.</p><h2>Snelheidsdisciplines</h2><p>In afdaling en super-G combineert Hütter technische precisie met onbevreesde snelheid.</p>", "ar": "<p>قصة كورنيليا هوتر هي قصة عزيمة وعودة. تغلبت المتزلجة النمساوية على إصابات خطيرة متعددة.</p><h2>قصة العودة</h2><p>تميزت مسيرة هوتر بالتألق والمحن.</p><h2>سباقات السرعة</h2><p>في الانحدار والسوبر جي، تجمع هوتر بين الدقة التقنية والسرعة الجريئة.</p>", "ja": "<p>コルネリア・ヒュッターの物語は、決意とカムバックの物語です。オーストリアの<a href=\"/alpine-skiing-guide/\">アルペンスキー</a>選手は、複数の深刻な怪我を乗り越えてきました。</p><h2>カムバック物語</h2><p>ヒュッターのキャリアは輝きと逆境に満ちていました。</p><h2>スピード種目</h2><p>ダウンヒルとスーパーGで、ヒュッターは技術的な精度と恐れを知らないスピードを兼ね備えています。</p>", "zh": "<p>Cornelia Huetter de gushi shi yige guanyu juexin he guilai de gushi. Zhe wei Aodili <a href=\"/alpine-skiing-guide/\">gaoshan huaxue</a> xuanshou kefu le duoci yanzhong shangbing.</p><h2>Guilai gushi</h2><p>Huetter de zhiye shengya chongman le guangcai he nanjing.</p><h2>Sudu xiangmu</h2><p>Zai huajiang he chaojidashanzhuan zhong, Huetter jiehe le jishu jingdu he wuwei de sudu.</p>", "ko": "<p>코르넬리아 휘터의 이야기는 결단력과 컴백의 이야기입니다. 오스트리아의 <a href=\"/alpine-skiing-guide/\">알파인 스키</a> 선수는 여러 번의 심각한 부상을 극복했습니다.</p><h2>컴백 스토리</h2><p>휘터의 경력은 빛남과 역경으로 가득했습니다.</p><h2>스피드 종목</h2><p>다운힐과 슈퍼G에서 휘터는 기술적 정확성과 대담한 속도를 결합합니다.</p>"}'::jsonb,
    'athlete-profile',
    'AS',
    '{"en": "Cornelia Hütter profile - Austrian alpine skiing speed specialist who made an inspiring comeback after serious injuries to compete at the world''s highest level.", "de": "Cornelia Hütter Profil - Österreichische Speed-Spezialistin im Ski Alpin.", "fr": "Profil de Cornelia Hütter - Spécialiste autrichienne de la vitesse en ski alpin.", "it": "Profilo di Cornelia Hütter - Specialista austriaca della velocità nello sci alpino.", "es": "Perfil de Cornelia Hütter - Especialista austriaca en velocidad del esquí alpino.", "pt": "Perfil de Cornelia Hütter - Especialista austríaca em velocidade no esqui alpino.", "nl": "Cornelia Hütter profiel - Oostenrijkse snelheidsspecialiste in alpine skiën.", "ar": "ملف كورنيليا هوتر - متخصصة السرعة النمساوية في التزلج الألبي", "ja": "コルネリア・ヒュッターのプロフィール - オーストリアのアルペンスキー・スピードスペシャリスト", "zh": "Cornelia Huetter jianjie - Aodili gaoshan huaxue sudu zhuanjia", "ko": "코르넬리아 휘터 프로필 - 오스트리아 알파인 스키 스피드 전문가"}'::jsonb,
